# 9. LCD Module — 1 Unit

An LCD module provides a local user interface for the system.

### Why an LCD was selected

An LCD provides immediate feedback without requiring the user to connect to a computer or external application.

The display can be used to show information such as:

* Soil moisture
* Zone status
* Valve status
* Water level
* Irrigation status
* System state
* Emergency-stop status
* Environmental data

For example:

```text
ZONE 1: 42%
ZONE 2: 67%
ZONE 3: 51%

Tank: 74%
Status: NORMAL
```

This makes the system easier to monitor during testing and operation.

