# 🔧 Active and Passive Components

The system contains both active and passive electronic components.

### Active components

The main active components include:

* ESP32 MCU
* Capacitive soil-moisture sensors
* Water-level sensor
* Relay module
* Solenoid valves
* LCD module

These components either process signals, generate signals, sense physical conditions or perform an electrical/mechanical action.

### Passive components

The primary passive components currently used are:

* Pull-up resistors
* Wiring/connectors
* Other passive protection/interface components where required by the final circuit design

The pull-up resistors are particularly important because they establish reliable logic levels for the digital inputs.

